{'symbol': 'EPAM', 'date': '2019-10-09 22:30:00', 'title': 'EPAM SYSTEMS, INC. NAMES DIAMOND GLOBAL BUSINESS PARTNER OF UIPATH, ENHANCING RPA SOLUTIONS FOR GLOBAL CUSTOMERS', 'text': "EPAM SYSTEMS, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN NAMED A DIAMOND GLOBAL BUSINESS PARTNER OF UIPATH, AN ENTERPRISE ROBOTIC PROCESS AUTOMATION (RPA) SOFTWARE COMPANY. EPAM AND UIPATH'S PARTNERSHIP WILL ENABLE ITS JOINT CUSTOMERS TO INCREASE EFFICIENCIES AND IMPROVE CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE BY LEVERAGING INTELLIGENT AUTOMATION (IA) SOLUTIONS AND UIPATH'S RPA PLATFORM."}